  "description": {
   "en": "A New Madcap isekai cooking comedy featuring favorite hololive VTubers! Bon appétit!\n\nMeet Akai Haato, a girl with cooking so powerful that she isekai'd herself with a single bite. Waking up in a new world, she meets the horned shepherd Tsunomaki Watame, the popular local café's poster girl Shiranui Flare, and the knight order commander Shirogane Noel.\n\nJoin these four for a heartwarming feast, with a main course of smiles and a side of chaos, as they explore the cuisine of the hololive Alternative world together, all depicted with a tender hand by manga artist Johanne!"
  },
